とも簡単なことであり、もっとも困難なことでもあるわね。","nextNodeIds":[130280217]},{"nodeId":130280217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1328470354,"text":"引き続き「成長」していく必要がある。","nextNodeIds":[130280218]},{"nodeId":130280218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":4142030162,"text":"ええ、あの子たちからは色々教わったわね。","nextNodeIds":[130280219]},{"nodeId":130280219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":973071706,"text":"「本望」という言葉を聞いた時、理解はできたけど、なかなか受け入れられなかったわ。","nextNodeIds":[130280220]},{"nodeId":130280220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":3695505602,"text":"あの声がなぜあんなにも明るかったのか、私には分からない。あんなに悲しいことだったのに…","nextNodeIds":[130280221]},{"nodeId":130280221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":1760987778,"text":"私はまた、「共感」できなくなったみたい。","nextNodeIds":[130280222,130280223]},{"nodeId":130280222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":135328882,"text":"#これは{M#君}{F#あなた}の問題じゃない。","nextNodeIds":[130280224]},{"nodeId":130280224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":3428075650,"text":"慰めてくれてありがとう…","nextNodeIds":[130280225]},{"nodeId":130280225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":855643218,"text":"感情って本当に複雑だわ。これからも勉強に励んでいかないと。","nextNodeIds":[130280226]},{"nodeId":130280226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textMapHash":1184994058,"text":"あら？","nextNodeIds":[130280227]},{"nodeId":130280227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13163,"speakerName":"プカプカ水キノコン","textMapHash":1397768738,"text":"~♪","nextNodeIds":[130280228]},{"nodeId":130280228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13164,"speakerName":"プカプカ水キノコン","textMapHash":3593542594,"text":"～♪～♪","nextNodeIds":[130280229]},{"nodeId":130280229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1056,"speakerName":"ナヒーダ","textM